# Only one regessor and an intercept, so q = 1, one restriction t test =
# F test = t^2
# this is the same as writing F test in its R^2 form!
# t^2 = F = R^2 / (1-R^2)/(n-2)
# which in turn gives: 189.5834363
# but we are looking for t stat not t^2 so:
sqrt(189.5834363)
